* 2.mp4
* 2.zip
* 2.bak
* 2.bak-*

# Sensitive: student materials, lesson plans, teacher resources — live in Somerset App repo only
public/materials-src/

# Research notes from AI agents — not part of the website
research_notes/
reports/

# Archive / retired files — keep locally, never ship
_to_delete/

